Greg Sevilla is the CEO of Upright Solutions and Systems Consultancy Corp. and currently serves as the Managing Director of Avior Marine Inc. His professional journey is rooted in dedication, discipline, and continuous growth. Starting as a cadet, he steadily advanced through the ranks until becoming Master Mariner in 2015.

Greg has also served as a Marine Superintendent in both the Netherlands and Germany, gaining extensive experience in international maritime operations. Beyond his operational background, he has supported Avior as a business consultant, strengthening organizational development and maritime leadership initiatives.

He owns several companies under the Oceanwide Group, providing services in:

Maritime training

Consultancy

Marine surveying

Audit and inspection

Greg holds two bachelor's degrees — one in Information Technology and another in Marine Transportation — and completed his Master’s degree in Shipping Management from the PMMA Graduate School.

He plays an active role in the Philippine maritime sector as:

Trustee, Association of Licensed Manning Agencies (ALMA)

Member, Technical Panel for Maritime Education (MARINA)

Member, Technical Panel for Higher Education (CHED)

Greg believes that true leadership is grounded in people. He is most inspired not by business itself, but by the individuals behind it — investing in their growth, creating opportunities, and building meaningful partnerships.

He continues to advocate for maritime development, leadership excellence, and industry-wide collaboration.